        {
            "id": 6673666,
            "title": "盤中速報 - 恆生科技指數上漲139.02點至3556.4點，漲幅4.07%",
            "description": "<main class=\"c1tt5pk2\" id=\"article-container\" style=\"--c1tt5pk2-0:20px\"><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>截至台北時間27日01:00，恆生科技指數上漲139.02點（或4.07%），暫報3556.40點。</p></section><p></p><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p><em>歷史漲跌幅</em></p></section><section style=\"margin-top:20px\"><ul><li>近 1 週：-6.35%</li><li>近 1 月：-11.41%</li><li>近 3 月：-26.13%</li><li>近 6 月：-30.92%</li><li>今年以來：-38.05%</li></ul></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p><em>焦點個股</em></p></section><div class=\"i1y9ycug\"></div><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>半導體概念領漲+5.61%。其中    康特隆(<a data-ga-click-item=\"HKS:01912:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/hkstock/quote/01912\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">01912-HK</a>)            上漲        20.53%            ;        華虹宏力(<a data-ga-click-item=\"HKS:01347:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/hkstock/quote/01347\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">01347-HK</a>)            上漲        9.81%            ;        天璽曜１１(<a data-ga-click-item=\"HKS:01010:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/hkstock/quote/01010\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">01010-HK</a>)            上漲        8.82%    。</p></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p><a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/GI/XAUUSDOZ\">黃金</a>及貴金屬概念領漲+4.72%。其中    靈寶<a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/GI/XAUUSDOZ\">黃金</a>(<a data-ga-click-item=\"HKS:03330:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/hkstock/quote/03330\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">03330-HK</a>)            上漲        9.03%            ;        中國<a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/GI/XAGUSDOZ\">白銀</a>集團(<a data-ga-click-item=\"HKS:00815:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/hkstock/quote/00815\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">00815-HK</a>)            上漲        8.63%            ;        中國<a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/GI/XAUUSDOZ\">黃金</a>國際(<a data-ga-click-item=\"HKS:02099:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/hkstock/quote/02099\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">02099-HK</a>)            上漲        8.18%    。</p></section></main>",
